        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8491ac/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-05T22:29:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm putting together a bi-monthly Sentinels Night in Berkeley, California. We're starting off mainly with Sentinels of the Multiverse but I'd like to eventually add Sentinel Tactics as well. If you live in the Bay Area, I'd love you for you to come by sometime<span>. I</span><span>'m also open to holding meetups in other locations in the future.</span></p><p>For more details, check out&nbsp;<a href=\"http://meetup.com/sentinels-of-the-multiverse\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">our Meetup Group</a>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Side Questions for anyone who knows:</span></p><p>1) Is it okay to use to \"Sentinels of the Multiverse\" in my group name?</p><p>2) Do I need permission to use official artwork for the group?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:39.689Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
