        "raw": "<p>I&#39;m putting together a bi-monthly Sentinels Night in Berkeley, California. We&#39;re starting off mainly with Sentinels of the Multiverse but I&#39;d like to eventually add Sentinel Tactics as well. If you live in the Bay Area, I&#39;d love you for you to come by sometime<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">. I</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">&#39;m also open to holding meetups in other locations in the future.</span></p><p>For more details, check out&nbsp;<a href=\"http://meetup.com/sentinels-of-the-multiverse\">our Meetup Group</a>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Side Questions for anyone who knows:</span></p><p>1) Is it okay to use to &quot;Sentinels of the Multiverse&quot; in my group name?</p><p>2) Do I need permission to use official artwork for the group?</p>",
