        "created_at": "2015-02-15T07:01:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can't speak authoritatively, but my guesses are:&nbsp;</p><p>#1 -- Probably no problem, as long as you're not selling anything</p><p>#2 -- Maybe depends what you're doing with the artwork and what you mean by official, but probably best to get someone from GtG to give the ok.</p>",
